<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; margin: 0; padding: 20px;">
    <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600">
        <tr>
            <td style="padding-bottom: 10px;">
                <p>Hello,</p>
                <p>The following campaign member(s) have been deleted in Salesforce but have a Lyyti ID, which means they may still exist in Lyyti.</p>
                <p>Please review the corresponding participant(s) in Lyyti and take the necessary action to ensure the data remains consistent between Salesforce and Lyyti.</p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>
                {_Datatable_}
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="padding-top: 20px; font-size: 10pt; color: #666666;">
                <p>This is an automated notification. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>